# compute_delete_and_recreate: Objects are created on first use and cached, and deletion (opcode 40) drops the cache entry. The guest rewrites pipeline P's record to name add_one's function instead of double_gid's: P still runs double_gid. After DeleteObject 1006 (compute pipeline) P is created again from the new record and runs add_one. Then the guest names double_gid's function again in P, but points that function's record at add_one's metallib, and deletes the function (1005) and P (1006): add_one runs. A fence deleted (1009) and used again is created again. DeleteObject's payload is {u32 taskID, u32 operation, u32 length, u32 ref}.
